{"id":"u-3b589c5f-384b-42fb-ba69-d7cbb9970e82","src":"community","title":"Femboy workout","author":"Darkvex89","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/eox9bj-fem-workout","desc":"You only need dumbbells and a pull up bar as the scapular pull ups are optional.\n\nA workout based for weightloss, for the walking and building some muscle more towards your legs for a more feminine body. I usually do 15 lb dumbbells, but go crazy. And as a fat person i can say this is very doable. For walking uphill/downhill, find a hill/road that goes down, walk 15 minutes down hill then 15 minutes uphill. Walk hours before your workout as to separate your walks and exercises. At max for the days you work out, the exercises should day 40 minutes max.\n\nfor the dumbbell exercises, to not waste time heres what i do:\n\ncurlpress (curl into overpress) 12 reps, rest 1 minute then do both curl and hammer as 1 rep for 6 reps total. and that is 1 set for all the dumbbel exercises out of 3.\n\nFor sumosquats and squats its almost the same:\n\n12 reps of sumo squats with dumbbells, then rest 1 minute to 12 bodyweight squats as 1 set for both of them.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Bodyweight Fitness","Muscle"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":40,"joins":25,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-23T13:26:45.614Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["reset day/sunday","monday","leg day/tuesday","wednesday","upperbody day/thursday","Friday","leg day pt 2/saturday"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Walk","sets":[{"sec":900}]},{"n":"Glute Bridge (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60}]},{"n":"Stomach vacuums","sets":[{"sec":300}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Walk","sets":[{"sec":1800}]},{"n":"Stomach vacuums","sets":[{"sec":300}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Walk down/uphill","sets":[{"sec":900,"x":2}]},{"n":"Sumo Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"side lying leg raises","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Glute Bridge (Bodyweigh